oadAudioUI", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [514.8785400390625, 398], "pos": [3083.641845703125, 91.86820220947266], "id": 27, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "__load_audio_ui_trim": {"duration": 28, "start_time": 41.63, "end_time": 69.63, "audio": "b8e55eed918347320f5e32ce35d92d5cac2a141cbb70ad4fce93a98c0eebf882.flac"}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadAudioUI"}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["这里参数基本不用调了。仔细学习下置顶的教程吧。可以自己试试"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [210, 88], "pos": [4449.671875, 436.53094482421875], "id": 38, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["timbre_strength 音色参考强度值：👉\n官方默认值是 0.7，这通常是一个比较平衡的起点。\n\n调高（>0.7）的代价：虽然能增强音色相似度，但会显著增加音频中的“ artifacts（伪影）”、电音感和抖动，使声音听起来不自然。\n\n调低（<0.7）的作用：能让转换后的声音更平滑、自然，但代价是音色匹配度会下降，可能听起来不太像你提供的参考音色。\n\n建议的操作：先将 timbre_strength 回调到 0.6 ~ 0.7 之间测试，优先保证声音的自然度。如果觉得不够像，再以 0.05 为步长微调，找到一个自然度和相似度的平衡点。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [313.51776123046875, 252.6646270751953], "pos": [3680.635986328125, 462.3609924316406], "id": 21, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["截取25-28秒！不能超过30！👉\nCapture 25–28 seconds! No more than 30! 👉"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [210, 88], "pos": [2861.1689453125, 415.9937744140625], "id": 37, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["-timbre_strength: Timbre Reference Strength Value: ↑\nThe official default value is 0.7, which generally serves as a well-balanced starting point.\nTradeoff of higher values (>0.7): While timbre similarity can be improved, it will noticeably introduce more audio artifacts, robotic effects and jitter, making the voice sound unnatural.\nEffect of lower values (<0.7): The converted voice will become smoother and more natural, at the cost of reduced timbre matching; the result may not sound much like your reference timbre.\nRecommended workflow: First set timbre_strength back to the range of 0.6 ~ 0.7 for testing, prioritizing natural voice quality. If the timbre resemblance is insufficient, fine-tune it in steps of 0.05 to strike a balance between naturalness and similarity.\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [313.51776123046875, 252.6646270751953], "pos": [4018.387939453125, 569.89892578125], "id": 40, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["你的声纹音频是5-25秒的清晰干声，没有背景音乐和明显混响。👉\nYour voiceprint audio is a clear dry signal from 5 to 25 seconds, with no background music and obvious reverb.👉"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [221.85145568847656, 109.78104400634766], "pos": [3779.1884765625, 298.8357238769531], "id": 34, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [{"name": "audio", "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["vocal trans", "flac"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 22, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}, {"widget": {"name": "format"}, "name": "format", "label": "format", "type": "COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3", "localized_name": "format"}], "flags": {}, "type": "SaveAudioAdvanced", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [433.81854248046875, 84.29821014404297], "pos": [4917.0498046875, 164.91285705566406], "id": 26, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveAudioAdvanced"}, "order": 16}, {"outputs": [{"name": "audio", "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}], "color": "#223", "widgets_values": ["instrument", "flac"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 33, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}, {"widget": {"name": "format"}, "name": "format", "label": "format", "type": "COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3", "localized_name": "format"}], "flags": {}, "type": "SaveAudioAdvanced", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [361.1794128417969, 82], "pos": [4927.75830078125, 393.2737731933594], "id": 30, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveAudioAdvanced"}, "order": 18}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "anything", "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "size": [270, 82], "pos": [3708.888916015625, 70.88910675048828], "widgets_values": [true, true], "inputs": [{"name": "anything", "link": 35, "label": "anything", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}, {"widget": {"name": "purge_cache"}, "name": "purge_cache", "label": "purge_cache", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "purge_cache"}, {"widget": {"name": "purge_models"}, "name": "purge_models", "label": "purge_models", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "purge_models"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 36, "type": "PurgeVRAM_UTK", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PurgeVRAM_UTK"}, "order": 14}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["关键参数与设置排查\n有几个参数和设置直接关系到翻唱质量：\n\n你的声纹质量是“决定性因素”。节点对参考音频有非常严格的要求，这是官方指南反复强调的：\n你的声音必须是“干声”：推荐5-25秒，清晰单人干声，尽量少混响、无伴奏。如果上传的音频里混有鼓点、房间混响或背景音乐，模型会把这些也当作“音色”的一部分学进去，导致输出浑浊、怪异。\n\n## [最佳实践方法：跟着原唱唱30秒然后上传干声。一段一段做翻唱效果是最好的。如果怕麻烦，那就仅仅录制低音和高潮部分，以便让模型获得你的高低音的声纹信息](1)\n\nauto_match_pitch（自动匹配音高）建议：\n如果你的音色（比如女声）和原曲人声（比如男声）音域不同，强烈建议将 auto_match_pitch 设为 true，让引擎自动处理移调。这比手动设置 semitone_shift 更不容易出错。\n\ndiffusion_steps（扩散步数）是质量与速度的权衡\n你用的 30 是官方默认值，属于“均衡”档位。如果追求更高质量，可以尝试提高到 40-50，但生成时间会显著增加。如果只是想快速测试参数方向，可以降到 15 左右，但不要期望太好的音质。\n\n检查人声/伴奏音量平衡\n vocal_gain_db 和 accompaniment_gain_db：如果翻唱后感觉人声被伴奏淹没，应该优先提高 vocal_gain_db（比如 +2 到 +4 dB）。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [463.4833984375, 362.4114074707031], "pos": [3390.532470703125, -654.2236328125], "id": 41, "properties": {}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["### -Troubleshooting Key Parameters and Settings\nSeveral parameters and settings directly affect the quality of voice conversion covers:\nThe quality of your voiceprint is the \"decisive factor\". The node has strict requirements for reference audio, which is repeatedly emphasized in the official guidelines:\nYour audio must be a \"dry vocal track\": 5–25 seconds is recommended, a clear solo dry vocal with minimal reverb and no accompaniment. If the uploaded audio contains drum beats, room reverb or background music, the model will learn these as part of the \"timbre\", resulting in muddy and weird output.\n## [Best practice: Sing along with the original track for 30 seconds and upload the dry vocal. Creating covers in segments yields the best results. If you want a simpler workflow, record only the low-pitched sections and choruses so the model can capture your voiceprint across your high and low ranges](1)\n-Recommendations for auto_match_pitch:\nIf your timbre (e.g., female voice) has a different vocal range from the original vocal (e.g., male voice), it is strongly recommended to set auto_match_pitch to true and let the engine handle pitch shifting automatically. This is less error-prone than manually setting semitone_shift.\n### -diffusion_steps represents a trade-off between quality and speed\nThe value 30 you are using is the official default, which is the \"balanced\" setting. For higher quality, you can try increasing it to 40–50, though generation time will rise significantly. If you only want a quick parameter test, you can lower it to around 15, but do not expect great audio quality.\n### -Check the volume balance between vocals and accompaniment\nvocal_gain_db and accompaniment_gain_db: If the converted vocal is overpowered by the accompaniment after generation, prioritize increasing vocal_gain_db (for example, +2 to +4 dB)."], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [495.24273681640625, 456.69976806640625], "pos": [3908.541748046875, -654.7006225585938], "id": 42, "properties": {}, "order": 11}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "pixaromaGroups": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "frontendVersion": "1.28.7", "ds": {"offset": [-3161.6514063280842, 812.9401568411793], "scale": 1.167184107045027}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "音色替换结果/Voice timbre replacement result", "bounding": [4907.0498046875, 91.31285858154297, 521.3446044921875, 174.14015197753906]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 4, "title": "伴奏accompaniment", "bounding": [4912.13916015625, 304.0689697265625, 515.7553100585938, 196.4976043701172]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 5, "title": "教程Tutorial", "bounding": [3371.632568359375, -733.981689453125, 1053.240478515625, 547.8952026367188]}], "links": [[17, 23, 0, 22, 0, "YUE2_MODEL"], [18, 19, 0, 22, 2, "AUDIO"], [19, 20, 0, 22, 4, "FLOAT"], [22, 22, 0, 26, 0, "AUDIO"], [24, 29, 0, 28, 0, "MELROFORMERMODEL"], [25, 27, 0, 28, 1, "AUDIO"], [28, 28, 1, 31, 0, "*"], [32, 31, 0, 35, 0, "*"], [33, 35, 0, 30, 0, "AUDIO"], [34, 28, 0, 22, 1, "AUDIO"], [35, 28, 0, 36, 0, "*"]], "id": "0cb4d4de-cda8-4474-a658-6b7cceeb8381", "config": {}, "version": 0.4, "last_node_id": 42, "revision": 0}